<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's Espirito Santo delays new coffee estimate.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Espirito Santo delays new coffee estimate.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's Espirito Santo state agricultural secretariat is to release its second estimate for the state's crop on April 15, said the agronomist responsible for the secretariat's coffee estimates.</p>
<p>Originally the secretariat had hoped to have the figure today but computer problems were causing a one-day delay, said Marcos Moulin.</p>
<p>Last week Moulin said he expected the new estimate to be little changed from a forecast of 3.59 million bags published by the secretariat in December.</p>
<p>((-Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151))</p>
